  "description": "Four-input DR103 Normal high path with the plate-driven three-band stack, master volume and V3A stage. The Audio Brothers 1975-circuit reissue uses the ECC81 phase inverter, matched EL34 quartet, 16 Ω output and original feedback and Presence network.",
